WEBVTT

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:28.910
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.740 --> 00:00:34.150
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.350 --> 00:00:38.980
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:43.490
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.060 --> 00:00:46.860
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.860 --> 00:00:51.430
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:56.470
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.470 --> 00:00:59.140
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.140 --> 00:01:01.340
Give thanks!

00:01:01.340 --> 00:01:04.540
Let’s eat!

00:01:04.980 --> 00:01:10.350
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.350 --> 00:01:15.490
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.490 --> 00:01:20.760
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.030 --> 00:01:24.930
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:31.000
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:33.810
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.810 --> 00:01:36.370
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.370 --> 00:01:38.980
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:38.980 --> 00:01:43.250
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:47.720 --> 00:01:50.390
Someone once said...

00:01:50.390 --> 00:01:54.590
There is cauliflower that 
bears crispy fried oysters...

00:01:54.590 --> 00:01:58.130
Caulifried Oysters!

00:02:02.400 --> 00:02:08.240
There are bantam roosters that lay pumpkin 
eggs as sweet as pumpkin pudding...

00:02:08.810 --> 00:02:11.810
Pumpkintam Roosters!

00:02:13.780 --> 00:02:17.080
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:17.080 --> 00:02:22.090
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:24.520 --> 00:02:28.230
Toriko and Komatsu were about 
to set forth on another journey

00:02:28.230 --> 00:02:31.400
to capture the next ingredient, 
when Rin suddenly appeared!

00:02:31.400 --> 00:02:33.300
Toriko!

00:02:33.300 --> 00:02:33.930
Rin!

00:02:33.930 --> 00:02:38.470
There's an emergency! Chief Mansom 
has an urgent request for you!

00:02:44.240 --> 00:02:46.740
What is the request for Toriko and Komatsu?

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:53.450
Um... Where are we going exactly?

00:02:54.190 --> 00:02:55.320
There it is...

00:02:55.520 --> 00:03:00.730
That's the Gourmet prison... Honey Prison!

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:08.330
Gathering of the Four Kings! 
A Midwinter Night's Miracle!

00:03:13.600 --> 00:03:14.710
Warden Love!

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:17.010
They're here.

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:19.910
So they came...

00:03:23.510 --> 00:03:26.820
Beautiful!

00:03:25.320 --> 00:03:26.820
Hey... Toriko!

00:03:27.790 --> 00:03:30.460
She's the warden of Honey Prison?!

00:03:32.320 --> 00:03:33.320
Coco, you too?!

00:03:34.230 --> 00:03:36.630
What have you done to my Toriko?!

00:03:36.630 --> 00:03:39.130
If you lay a hand on him, I'll 
knock you into next week!

00:03:39.130 --> 00:03:41.200
You've got a nasty mouth, young lady.

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:44.000
I only have eyes for Zebra-chan!

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:46.500
Huh? Zebra-chan isn't with you?!

00:03:47.110 --> 00:03:50.170
I just got a call from Chief Mansom.

00:03:50.170 --> 00:03:53.040
It seems Zebra turned down the request.

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:55.850
What?! Then this is a waste of pheromones!

00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:00.280
She transformed!

00:04:00.280 --> 00:04:04.660
No. That is the power of 
Warden Love's pheromones.

00:04:04.660 --> 00:04:06.290
You called Zebra too?

00:04:06.290 --> 00:04:09.990
It seems all Four Kings have been summoned.

00:04:09.990 --> 00:04:12.800
All four?! What kind of request is it?!

00:04:12.800 --> 00:04:15.230
Mr. Patch is missing.

00:04:15.230 --> 00:04:16.430
Mr. Patch...?

00:04:17.300 --> 00:04:20.000
You mean Patch-san from G7?!

00:04:20.300 --> 00:04:24.740
Yes. He was deep in the Death Season Forest

00:04:24.740 --> 00:04:26.540
when we lost radio communication with him.

00:04:27.050 --> 00:04:30.010
We want you to bring Mr. Patch back.

00:04:30.010 --> 00:04:32.680
The forest... Right now it's Freeze Season!

00:04:33.020 --> 00:04:36.850
Yes. As you say, it's Freeze Season,

00:04:35.990 --> 00:04:41.630
Death Season Forest, Freeze Season

00:04:36.850 --> 00:04:41.630
when a blizzard rages, freezing everything.

00:04:42.990 --> 00:04:46.460
It's said that the blizzard never 
ceases during Freeze Season,

00:04:46.460 --> 00:04:50.700
but once every several years, it 
does stop for a number of hours.

00:04:51.300 --> 00:04:54.170
It's called Cold Holiday, when 
the freezing cold abates.

00:04:52.140 --> 00:04:55.110
Cold Holiday

00:04:55.510 --> 00:04:59.580
Patch-dono went into the Death 
Season Forest on Cold Holiday,

00:05:00.040 --> 00:05:03.280
along with Johannes-dono from IGO's 
Research and Development Bureau.

00:05:03.610 --> 00:05:05.320
Johannes-san, too?!

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:08.690
A Gourmet Hunter who works exclusively 
with IGO accompanied them,

00:05:08.690 --> 00:05:09.920
but even though it's Cold Holiday,

00:05:09.920 --> 00:05:11.920
it is still a harsh environment.

00:05:11.920 --> 00:05:15.430
He became separated from Patch-dono 
and had no choice but to turn back.

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:17.760
But why the forest?

00:05:18.300 --> 00:05:20.370
Their goal was the Sweet Nectar Tree.

00:05:20.370 --> 00:05:20.870
Wha...?!

00:05:20.870 --> 00:05:25.340
The Sweet Nectar Tree?! That 
legendary tree is in the forest?!

00:05:31.580 --> 00:05:34.210
This forest is huge!

00:05:34.850 --> 00:05:38.480
At any rate, these winter clothes we borrowed

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:40.550
look just like Santa Claus suits...

00:05:40.550 --> 00:05:42.190
I can understand that they're 
effective against the cold

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:44.660
and stand out in the forest...

00:05:44.660 --> 00:05:48.130
But even these harvest sacks 
we borrowed are Santa-like!

00:05:48.130 --> 00:05:50.190
I wonder if it's Warden Love's hobby?

00:05:50.190 --> 00:05:53.360
It's cute! And what's more, I get 
to do a pair look with Toriko!

00:05:53.360 --> 00:05:54.870
There's nothing better!

00:05:54.870 --> 00:05:57.740
<i>Pair</i> look? All four of us match...

00:05:59.200 --> 00:06:01.040
Um... Toriko-san...

00:06:01.810 --> 00:06:05.640
Just what kind of tree 
is the Sweet Nectar Tree?

00:06:05.640 --> 00:06:07.550
You said it was legendary...

00:06:07.850 --> 00:06:11.520
From the trunk to the leaves, 
the entire tree is edible.

00:06:11.820 --> 00:06:13.320
The sap is sweet...

00:06:13.320 --> 00:06:16.050
The trunk is soft and moist.

00:06:16.050 --> 00:06:20.660
The leaves are beautiful and 
melt on your tongue like candy.

00:06:21.830 --> 00:06:24.500
Although I haven't seen one myself yet...

00:06:25.100 --> 00:06:27.570
It's heat-sensitive and grows in winter,

00:06:27.570 --> 00:06:31.470
but only in a cold region that's 
-100 degrees below or less.

00:06:31.470 --> 00:06:33.910
It's quite difficult to find one.

00:06:33.910 --> 00:06:36.570
So that's why it's legendary...

00:06:36.570 --> 00:06:40.850
But why did Patch-san seek 
out the Sweet Nectar Tree,

00:06:40.850 --> 00:06:44.220
when his job is to rate 
restaurants and chefs?

00:06:44.220 --> 00:06:45.020
Toriko!

00:06:46.020 --> 00:06:47.490
A wireless!

00:06:50.960 --> 00:06:52.160
That's...

00:06:56.260 --> 00:06:57.500
This...

00:06:58.930 --> 00:07:00.260
...is Johannes-san's!

00:07:00.260 --> 00:07:02.400
No wonder they couldn't get through.

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:04.040
But what happened...?

00:07:12.580 --> 00:07:17.220
Bison Frog (Amphibious 
Beast) Capture Level 35

00:07:14.650 --> 00:07:17.020
That's a Bison Frog!

00:07:17.720 --> 00:07:20.020
They're supposed to be 
hibernating in this season!

00:07:20.350 --> 00:07:23.790
With the blizzard paused, it must 
think Freeze Season is over!

00:07:25.160 --> 00:07:27.030
A bunch of them are waking up!

00:07:37.470 --> 00:07:38.940
Spatula!

00:07:47.350 --> 00:07:50.010
A beautiful entrance... of course.

00:07:50.180 --> 00:07:51.720
Santa Sunny-san!

00:07:51.720 --> 00:07:52.750
Santa Sunny?!

00:07:52.750 --> 00:07:56.190
Well, you're wearing a Santa 
suit and you're Sunny-san, so...

00:07:56.190 --> 00:07:58.990
I'm not wearing this hideous 
outfit because I want to!

00:07:58.990 --> 00:08:01.730
Warden Love forced me to put it on!

00:08:05.430 --> 00:08:07.800
Looks like the whole herd 
woke up from hibernation!

00:08:07.800 --> 00:08:09.570
There are more?

00:08:09.900 --> 00:08:13.300
It's gonna be a pain with this many...

00:08:13.300 --> 00:08:15.370
Think I'll try a little intimidation.

00:08:15.370 --> 00:08:16.240
Wait a second.

00:08:19.110 --> 00:08:19.880
Huh?

00:08:19.880 --> 00:08:22.380
W-What just happened?

00:08:29.790 --> 00:08:31.490
I smell somethin' totally sweet!

00:08:32.060 --> 00:08:32.620
Let's go!

00:08:32.620 --> 00:08:33.860
Wait...

00:08:36.560 --> 00:08:39.600
It's a sweet scent that 
excites the instincts!

00:08:39.600 --> 00:08:44.270
This is the Sweet Nectar Tree!

00:08:45.740 --> 00:08:49.540
Was that just Toriko's voice?

00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:52.740
Oh yeah, there it is...

00:08:53.580 --> 00:08:55.650
Another tasty-lookin' one...

00:09:01.620 --> 00:09:04.220
Don't even need my voice for this guy.

00:09:11.330 --> 00:09:14.730
Interesting. So that's how 
you wanna play it, huh?!

00:09:26.580 --> 00:09:28.950
It's 'cause you got cocky.

00:09:30.110 --> 00:09:32.650
That wasn't nice, Zebra-chan!

00:09:32.650 --> 00:09:37.120
Refusing the job! Even though we 
could have seen each other...!

00:09:37.920 --> 00:09:42.460
The conditions of his release from 
prison are discovering 100 new types

00:09:42.460 --> 00:09:45.560
of ingredients and capturing 
500 wanted criminals.

00:09:45.560 --> 00:09:48.200
I'm sure Zebra has his hands full.

00:09:48.730 --> 00:09:50.840
I'll bet he finished that stuff up long ago.

00:09:50.840 --> 00:09:52.470
We're talking about Zebra-chan here.

00:09:55.340 --> 00:09:57.480
It's noisier than usual around here.

00:09:58.380 --> 00:10:01.110
It seems that Beasts are 
awaking from hibernation

00:10:01.110 --> 00:10:02.950
under the mistaken notion 
that Freeze Season is over.

00:10:03.980 --> 00:10:04.950
And on top of that...

00:10:07.490 --> 00:10:10.760
...we've received information that 
the "White Demon" has awakened.

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:14.660
Oh. That's... not good.

00:10:15.960 --> 00:10:16.890
No, it's not.

00:10:20.200 --> 00:10:22.600
The Sweet Nectar Tree is close!

00:10:22.770 --> 00:10:24.640
Wait for me!

00:10:44.020 --> 00:10:46.690
What the heck is this?!

00:10:48.730 --> 00:10:49.390
That's...

00:10:49.990 --> 00:10:50.930
Ho...

00:10:51.860 --> 00:10:56.470
This scent! Ain't no mistake! This is...

00:10:59.000 --> 00:11:01.210
...the Sweet Nectar Tree!

00:11:02.740 --> 00:11:04.080
This is...

00:11:04.940 --> 00:11:06.010
H-Help...

00:11:07.550 --> 00:11:08.750
Somebody...

00:11:09.210 --> 00:11:10.920
Johannes-san!

00:11:23.060 --> 00:11:25.800
Delicious! Sweet like ginger ale!

00:11:25.800 --> 00:11:26.960
Just a tiny bit spicy!

00:11:27.270 --> 00:11:29.130
It's a Ginger Guts fruit.

00:11:29.130 --> 00:11:31.940
Ginger warms the body up, see...

00:11:32.470 --> 00:11:34.910
So what happened to Mr. Patch?

00:11:36.270 --> 00:11:37.780
He...

00:11:37.780 --> 00:11:39.040
Don't tell me he...

00:11:39.040 --> 00:11:41.180
Have you come to save us?!

00:11:41.180 --> 00:11:41.910
Patch-san?!

00:11:42.250 --> 00:11:44.280
Huh. You look well.

00:11:44.280 --> 00:11:46.180
Chef Komatsu! I appreciate 
you coming out here!

00:11:47.450 --> 00:11:48.220
Um...

00:11:48.220 --> 00:11:50.590
I'm very grateful! It 
takes a load off my mind.

00:11:50.590 --> 00:11:54.930
Now, please! Make something delicious 
out of this Sweet Nectar Tree.

00:11:57.600 --> 00:12:00.300
U-Um... What are you talking about?

00:12:00.300 --> 00:12:05.140
Tasting is believing. Anyway, 
try a taste of this tree!

00:12:05.140 --> 00:12:06.770
Er...

00:12:06.770 --> 00:12:07.810
Do it!

00:12:08.440 --> 00:12:10.270
R-Right...

00:12:14.450 --> 00:12:18.820
It's moist... Just like 
high quality sponge cake...

00:12:19.380 --> 00:12:21.050
Thank you for the food!

00:12:24.060 --> 00:12:27.590
Delicious! Maple syrup and honey...

00:12:27.590 --> 00:12:29.990
There's also the distinct taste of caramel!

00:12:30.530 --> 00:12:32.100
I also like how it melts in your mouth

00:12:32.100 --> 00:12:35.100
like first-rate smooth 
pudding! It's fantastic!

00:12:35.100 --> 00:12:39.040
Yeah. And I can understand how it 
needs to be in a cold region to grow.

00:12:39.040 --> 00:12:41.140
It's the perfect example of an ingredient 
that needs to be kept refrigerated.

00:12:41.140 --> 00:12:44.810
The leaves vanish like meringue 
when they hit your tongue!

00:12:44.810 --> 00:12:45.940
And they're delicious!

00:12:45.940 --> 00:12:47.910
Tell me more!

00:12:49.150 --> 00:12:50.010
Delicious!

00:12:50.650 --> 00:12:52.720
The taste is perfect.

00:12:52.720 --> 00:12:57.320
However, it doesn't pass 
muster with my tongue!

00:12:57.320 --> 00:13:00.020
I want a flavor that jolts 
my palate even more!

00:13:00.830 --> 00:13:02.760
Certainly, I get the feeling 
that it could be even tastier...

00:13:02.760 --> 00:13:04.160
I know, right?!

00:13:04.160 --> 00:13:07.830
Chef Komatsu, an ingredient raised in 
the same environment would match well.

00:13:07.830 --> 00:13:11.000
If something from this forest were used, 
I'm sure it would be more delicious!

00:13:11.000 --> 00:13:14.640
Seven-star... No, eight-star food!

00:13:14.640 --> 00:13:16.170
He's been like this since we got here.

00:13:17.010 --> 00:13:20.040
He told me to search for an ingredient 
that would be a match for this tree,

00:13:20.550 --> 00:13:22.880
and that's what I've been doing, 
searching until my legs gave out!

00:13:22.880 --> 00:13:25.550
You mean that's why you were on the ground?!

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:28.320
So, Chef Komatsu, do you have any ideas?

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:30.620
When you put me on the spot like this...

00:13:30.620 --> 00:13:32.890
Forget that! The blizzard's on its way!

00:13:32.890 --> 00:13:34.960
Plus there are a lot of 
disgusting Beasts around,

00:13:34.960 --> 00:13:38.060
but most of all, I hate this 
tacky outfit and want to go home!

00:13:38.060 --> 00:13:40.060
No, we can't afford to go home.

00:13:41.870 --> 00:13:43.740
We can't go home...

00:13:45.300 --> 00:13:46.300
Patch-san...

00:13:50.880 --> 00:13:55.110
Don't eat <i>that</i> much! It'll disappear!

00:13:55.110 --> 00:13:56.550
Oh, that!

00:13:57.780 --> 00:14:02.650
This might work! It could make the 
Sweet Nectar Tree even more delicious!

00:14:05.320 --> 00:14:06.090
Snap.

00:14:06.390 --> 00:14:08.660
A Candy Icicle. It's beautiful!

00:14:09.130 --> 00:14:12.660
Chocolate Rocks, Chocolate 
Stones... That's a possibility.

00:14:12.660 --> 00:14:13.870
Anything else?

00:14:16.800 --> 00:14:18.670
I think it's about ready. Please.

00:14:22.070 --> 00:14:24.680
The ginger cookie is finished!

00:14:24.680 --> 00:14:27.550
A ginger cookie made from 
Ginger Guts fruit...

00:14:27.550 --> 00:14:28.850
Chef Komatsu is brilliant.

00:14:29.310 --> 00:14:30.820
Matsu, how's this?

00:14:30.820 --> 00:14:32.320
That's...

00:14:32.920 --> 00:14:35.250
Right! Smooth it out, smooth it out...

00:14:35.520 --> 00:14:38.220
You turned it into a glass ball!

00:14:38.220 --> 00:14:39.660
Beautiful, isn't it?

00:14:43.930 --> 00:14:45.260
Up there?

00:14:45.260 --> 00:14:46.830
That's Santa Sunny for you!

00:14:46.830 --> 00:14:47.770
Santa Sunny?!

00:14:55.270 --> 00:14:58.710
Komatsu-kun thought of a Christmas tree...

00:14:58.710 --> 00:15:00.910
Toppings that look delicious...

00:15:00.910 --> 00:15:03.580
So much that I want to taste 
them right this minute...

00:15:03.580 --> 00:15:06.750
Actually, I owe this to 
Toriko-san and Rin-san,

00:15:06.750 --> 00:15:09.590
who were eating with such vigor.

00:15:09.590 --> 00:15:12.360
I pray that Toriko will be 
madly in love with me...

00:15:12.360 --> 00:15:15.130
You do that for the Star Festival!

00:15:14.790 --> 00:15:18.200
Tasting {all I can make out here}

00:15:15.130 --> 00:15:16.790
You too?!

00:15:18.760 --> 00:15:21.430
Wait'll you see the haul we got!

00:15:21.430 --> 00:15:23.400
They obviously found a lot, too.

00:15:23.400 --> 00:15:29.440
Fruit that sounds like a bell... 
Applerings and Strawbells!

00:15:29.870 --> 00:15:31.940
Mushrooms that taste like 
turkey... Mushturkey!

00:15:31.940 --> 00:15:35.150
Rock Onigiri and an Oden 
Stick from an Oden Tree!

00:15:35.150 --> 00:15:37.950
These are novel toppings!

00:15:37.950 --> 00:15:39.320
I don't think they go with the tree...

00:15:39.320 --> 00:15:43.290
This is the mysterious Macarock 
that tastes like macarons.

00:15:43.290 --> 00:15:46.920
I thought maybe we could use it 
to decorate the top of the tree.

00:15:46.920 --> 00:15:48.130
Here, Komatsu-kun.

00:15:48.930 --> 00:15:51.530
Wait-wait-wait-wait-wait!

00:15:51.530 --> 00:15:52.030
It's light!

00:15:53.200 --> 00:15:57.270
Despite its solidity, it's 
as light as cotton candy.

00:15:57.270 --> 00:16:00.410
There's no doubt that'll become 
the show-stopper of this tree.

00:16:00.670 --> 00:16:01.540
Toriko!

00:16:02.010 --> 00:16:03.370
Something's coming!

00:16:12.450 --> 00:16:14.950
So the "White Demon" is out there...

00:16:15.750 --> 00:16:19.020
A Beast of the forest that even 
the Magma Tortoise avoids...

00:16:19.520 --> 00:16:21.860
As strong as Toriko-dono is, 
I doubt even he is a match...

00:16:21.830 --> 00:16:26.760
Swordhorn (Mammalian Beast) Capture Level 70

00:16:21.860 --> 00:16:24.000
...for Swordhorn.

00:16:28.900 --> 00:16:29.800
I see...

00:16:32.070 --> 00:16:35.810
The Bison Frogs were scared of this guy...

00:16:36.810 --> 00:16:38.740
He's gonna try to eat our tree?!

00:16:40.980 --> 00:16:42.750
Fork Shield!

00:16:46.820 --> 00:16:47.550
Wha...?!

00:16:49.190 --> 00:16:50.590
What the hell...?!

00:16:50.590 --> 00:16:52.090
Toriko!

00:16:52.590 --> 00:16:54.730
There are tons of them!

00:16:55.060 --> 00:16:56.960
So they move as a herd?

00:16:56.960 --> 00:16:58.930
This doesn't look good. And 
the blizzard is on its way.

00:17:02.830 --> 00:17:05.200
Komatsu! Finish the tree!

00:17:06.770 --> 00:17:09.270
We'll do somethin' about them!

00:17:09.770 --> 00:17:10.310
Right!

00:17:13.680 --> 00:17:16.380
So what is this "something" 
that we're going to do?

00:17:17.450 --> 00:17:20.180
With their numbers, don't you think 
we'd be in the middle of the blizzard

00:17:20.180 --> 00:17:22.720
by the time we chased them all away?

00:17:22.920 --> 00:17:24.820
Then I guess our goose is cooked.

00:17:24.820 --> 00:17:27.230
Yeah, well... I don't 
think we have any choice.

00:17:31.260 --> 00:17:32.960
I've got to finish this...

00:17:37.870 --> 00:17:38.900
Hair Lock!

00:17:42.840 --> 00:17:43.940
Shook me right off!

00:17:43.940 --> 00:17:45.080
Poison Rifle!

00:17:55.020 --> 00:17:56.490
They're still coming!

00:18:06.630 --> 00:18:08.430
The sun is going down...

00:18:14.610 --> 00:18:16.610
Leg Knife!

00:18:19.180 --> 00:18:20.380
Hair Net!

00:18:27.220 --> 00:18:29.020
Let's pull out all the stops!

00:18:57.320 --> 00:19:00.150
The tree is finished...

00:19:05.590 --> 00:19:08.430
That sparkling soothes the soul...

00:19:09.160 --> 00:19:10.230
It's beautiful...

00:19:11.560 --> 00:19:12.660
Komatsu...

00:19:19.170 --> 00:19:22.970
The Macarock really suits 
the Sweet Nectar Tree.

00:19:27.480 --> 00:19:30.920
A glow that shines on everyone, 
treating all alike...

00:19:31.520 --> 00:19:34.590
It truly is just the right ingredient.

00:19:35.190 --> 00:19:37.520
Thank you, Chef Komatsu.

00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:43.800
I expect the blizzard will 
start any time now...

00:19:43.800 --> 00:19:45.600
Then we can't stand around gawking!

00:19:45.600 --> 00:19:48.500
Let's hurry up and eat this tree!

00:19:51.270 --> 00:19:54.940
Alright, fine... We'll 
share it with you guys.

00:19:54.940 --> 00:19:59.210
So... We give thanks for all 
this world's great bounty...

00:19:59.210 --> 00:20:00.110
Let's...

00:20:00.110 --> 00:20:02.110
You can't eat it!

00:20:02.810 --> 00:20:04.250
Why not?!

00:20:04.250 --> 00:20:09.920
Chief Mansom asked me to come here 
to <i>taste</i> the Sweet Nectar Tree.

00:20:09.920 --> 00:20:11.120
Chief Mansom?

00:20:11.360 --> 00:20:16.490
Why would G7 come all the way 
here just to check the flavor?

00:20:18.160 --> 00:20:20.260
Failure is not an option.

00:20:20.260 --> 00:20:25.200
The Four Kings weren't 
summoned just to rescue me.

00:20:25.200 --> 00:20:27.570
That's the first I've heard!

00:20:27.570 --> 00:20:31.140
Your strength is going to be needed.

00:20:32.740 --> 00:20:38.420
That's why this needs to 
be savored as it's eaten.

00:20:38.420 --> 00:20:42.750
Stop beating around the bush! Exactly 
who are you gonna have eat this?!

00:20:42.750 --> 00:20:43.660
That...

00:20:44.360 --> 00:20:47.930
...you should ask Chief Mansom himself.

00:21:55.590 --> 00:21:57.860
This week's Gourmet Fortune!

00:21:58.300 --> 00:22:00.400
Please choose one of these three platters.

00:22:01.730 --> 00:22:04.800
The higher the capture level, 
the more Gourmet Luck it has!

00:22:06.040 --> 00:22:06.970
Here we go!

00:22:07.670 --> 00:22:09.440
A heaping helping...

00:22:10.540 --> 00:22:11.540
Open!

00:22:13.710 --> 00:22:16.010
This week's best Gourmet Luck is...

00:22:16.450 --> 00:22:23.860
A - Air Gorilla Capture Level 68

00:22:17.350 --> 00:22:18.880
...yours if you chose A!

00:22:18.880 --> 00:22:21.090
Your constant efforts are recognized

00:22:21.090 --> 00:22:23.860
and you just might be praised all week long!

00:22:23.860 --> 00:22:31.130
B - Moai Potato Capture Level 10

00:22:24.490 --> 00:22:27.460
If you chose B, you get this 
week's second-best luck.

00:22:27.460 --> 00:22:29.560
If there's something you don't want 
to do, get it out of the way quickly.

00:22:29.560 --> 00:22:31.130
Good luck may arrive in its place!

00:22:31.130 --> 00:22:39.140
C - Friday Monkey Capture Level 2

00:22:32.060 --> 00:22:34.900
And I'm sorry. If you chose C, you're third.

00:22:34.900 --> 00:22:36.900
Being too greedy may bring on failure.

00:22:36.900 --> 00:22:39.140
Don't try to grab too much!

00:22:39.140 --> 00:22:42.610
Good Luck Charm Photo Time

00:22:39.600 --> 00:22:42.610
And finally, it's the customary 
Gourmet Good Luck Charm photo time!

00:22:42.770 --> 00:22:44.380
Alright, here we go!

00:22:45.140 --> 00:22:48.750
3... 2... 1... Scoop Chance!

00:22:49.110 --> 00:22:51.120
Keep believing!

00:22:51.120 --> 00:22:52.950
If you do, your wish...

00:22:52.950 --> 00:22:54.220
...will come true!

00:22:54.620 --> 00:22:57.120
Alright! I'll keep believing, too!

00:22:57.120 --> 00:23:00.220
I pray that I can bring 
everyone delicious news!

00:23:00.220 --> 00:23:03.590
News just came in about the next "Toriko"?

00:23:03.590 --> 00:23:04.900
Then please check it out!

00:23:07.000 --> 00:23:08.720
For the smiles of the children!

00:23:08.720 --> 00:23:10.740
Instead of a sleigh, he climbs aboard Terry...

00:23:10.740 --> 00:23:12.770
And Toriko flies through the night sky!

00:23:13.270 --> 00:23:16.370
Merry Feastmas! Gourmet Santa's Present!

00:23:16.650 --> 00:23:18.510
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
